        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your Heilig Bogen takes its full shape &mdash; a broad blue bow of light.</p><p>Your spirit weapon gains the <strong>Spirit Bow</strong> profile if it did not have it, its damage die increases by one step, and its range increment increases to <strong>100 feet</strong>.</p><p>You also gain <strong>Seele Schneider</strong> <em>(Soul Cutter)</em>: your bow may be used as a melee weapon, <strong>1d8 slashing</strong>, <strong>finesse</strong>, whose vibrating reishi edge means its Strikes <strong>ignore resistance to slashing damage</strong>.</p>"
